Phase 3: Hardware‑in‑the‑loop. Deploy the field on a cluster of edge devices with real power monitors. Calibrate the thermodynamic parameters \gamma,\eta,\sigma_{\max} from actual measurements. Verify that the adaptive diffusion prevents thermal throttling.

Phase 4: Planetary analog field test. Run the CFC on a simulated Mars habitat with heterogeneous robots (drones, rovers, stationary sensors). Measure emergent behavior: consensus formation, forgetting curves, resource efficiency. Use these to refine \alpha and the BUDT penalty coefficient \beta.

